# LINE ENDINGS: LF in the repo AND on disk, matching LegendaryMissions.
#
# A .mast read out of a mastlib ZIP is read as BYTES, with no CRLF translation - and
# on CRLF the label header rule stops matching, so a story compiles to NO LABELS and
# still reports PASS. `git status` calls a CRLF tree clean; `git ls-files --eol` is
# the honest check (`i/lf w/crlf` = mangled).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
